  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a medium pan, melt a 1/3 of the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071f0a7ff31c38760e0984/step-ec86c706.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Drain and rinse kidney beans.\n• Grate carrot. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves. Thinly slice brown onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071f0a7ff31c38760e0984/step-6a5185c1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins. Add carrot and kidney beans and cook until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir through tomato paste and BBQ spice blend (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and remaining garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add the water (for the sauce) and vegetable stock powder, cook, stirring occasionally, until thickened, 1-2 mins. Stir in the remaining butter and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071f0a7ff31c38760e0984/step-9afc6e48.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add corn and spinach to pan with garlic rice. Stir to combine.\n• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with bean chilli and yoghurt. Sprinkle with cheddar to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071f0a7ff31c38760e0984/step-d25aa861.jpg"
    }
  ]
